      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Even with gesture overrides, this gesture is broken. People do not see the correct gesture on two thumbs up. This causes issues in communication for users of sign language, and can affect other people’s understanding of what gesture you are doing (e.g. if I’m giving a friend thumbs up for finishing a game together, they get very confused because they don’t see it.)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
